WEBVTT

00:02:57.423 --> 00:03:00.593
Some companies will just
flat out refuse to hire you,

00:03:00.635 --> 00:03:03.930
and even if you have
the skills and the qualifications,

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:06.474
once they find out
you have a record, it's over.

00:03:06.974 --> 00:03:08.601
And this is a huge problem,

00:03:08.643 --> 00:03:13.689
because we know that one of the best ways
to prevent someone returning to prison

00:03:13.731 --> 00:03:14.857
is employment.

00:03:15.566 --> 00:03:17.276
And in some cases,

00:03:17.276 --> 00:03:19.987
employment is a condition
of someone's parole.

00:03:21.656 --> 00:03:24.784
A colleague of mine told me
about a man she'd met,

00:03:24.784 --> 00:03:27.286
who was released from prison on parole.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.790
The garage where he'd been
working was closing,